$A$ is \emph{smaller than}~$B$, written $\cardless{A}{B}$, iff there
is !!a{injection}~$f\colon A \to B$ but no !!{bijection}~$g\colon A
\to B$, i.e., $\cardle{A}{B}$ and $\cardneq{A}{B}$.
\end{defn}

